WEBVTT

00:00:02.460 --> 00:00:05.450
Hi there, I'm Jace Blackburn, founder and
CEO of GoSteady and I'm going to show

00:00:05.460 --> 00:00:07.260
you how to set up your device in less than
90 seconds.

00:00:07.667 --> 00:00:10.677
All right, so for the first step for
installing your GoSteady, you're going to

00:00:10.687 --> 00:00:13.297
loosen this knob on the side of the clamp a
few times until you have some good

00:00:13.307 --> 00:00:14.147
flex in here.

00:00:14.767 --> 00:00:17.267
Next, we're going to find where we want to
mount this on the walker.

00:00:17.387 --> 00:00:19.887
We're going to go ahead and mount on the
right side just beneath the hand grip.

00:00:20.347 --> 00:00:23.027
So, first things first, make sure you move
the brake cable out of the way.

00:00:23.107 --> 00:00:23.947
You don't want to clamp that.

00:00:24.487 --> 00:00:26.567
Then bring the clamp over the top and give
it a few turns.

00:00:27.187 --> 00:00:30.497
We don't need to go fully snug yet, as
we're going to next flip this

00:00:30.507 --> 00:00:32.767
up. Give the button one press here.

00:00:33.027 --> 00:00:34.507
You'll start to see some blue lights
flashing.

00:00:35.127 --> 00:00:37.837
And then finally, we're going to go ahead
and scan this QR code to do a few

00:00:37.847 --> 00:00:39.347
steps on the phone before we finish setup.

00:00:40.233 --> 00:00:42.113
We're going to go scan our QR code here.

00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:48.380
Go ahead and get started.

00:00:49.320 --> 00:00:52.470
The only fields required here are going to
be your

00:00:52.480 --> 00:00:54.060
name and phone number.

00:00:55.260 --> 00:00:58.510
Email is optional as another way of signing
in,

00:00:58.520 --> 00:01:01.810
but this is all really text-based

00:01:01.820 --> 00:01:03.560
in terms of passwords and resets.

00:01:04.120 --> 00:01:04.960
So we'll continue here.

00:01:05.900 --> 00:01:07.720
Give it one second as it gets set up.

00:01:08.420 --> 00:01:10.840
We'll be getting a login code for messages.

00:01:11.440 --> 00:01:14.830
Just verify that. And

00:01:14.840 --> 00:01:15.940
we're all set up.

00:01:16.133 --> 00:01:19.383
Alright, and in order to finish up, just
turn this down, give this a few

00:01:19.393 --> 00:01:22.453
turns until it's nice and snug, and you're
ready to roll.

00:01:22.933 --> 00:01:23.433
Enjoy!
